      "raw": {},
      "title": "Crowdfunded genomes start to bloom",
      "abstract": "<p>&lt;b&gt;\n Tis the (Bahinia flowering) season.\n&lt;/b&gt;\nOn behalf of the Bauhinia Genome team we\u2019d like to thank you for all your generous support. We eventually raised $2,608 USD ($20,215 HKD), which makes our efforts one of the largest \u201ccommunity genome\u201d projects to date. While those of you who have contributed will have recently seen an email from Indiegogo that the crowdfunding campaign is officially now over, the hard work is only just beginning.</p>",
